张军官宣操作系统层级 AI 助手“马维斯”正式上工，Windows、Mac、安卓端同步上线","originalTitle":"","summary":"腾讯于5月21日发布了操作系统层级AI助手“马维斯”，支持Windows、Mac和安卓平台同步上线。该助手具备文档归类解析、图片智能识别处理、系统维护等功能，并强调与操作系统深度集成，可调度不同模型处理任务，部分功能可在离线状态下使用。腾讯表示“马维斯”能完成市面主流Agent的大部分工作，并具备桌面操控手机应用等能力。这是继3月WorkBuddy和“龙虾”产品矩阵后，腾讯推出的又一AI助手产品。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpeq13j70ejcslk16skz7ozw","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/953/096.htm","publishedAt":"2026-05-21T00:00:12.163Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpeq13j70ejcslk16skz7ozw","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T12:49:10.831Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T12:49:10.831Z"}],"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","reportSummary":"腾讯于5月21日发布了操作系统层级AI助手“马维斯”，支持Windows、Mac和安卓平台同步上线。该助手具备文档归类解析、图片智能识别处理、系统维护等功能，并强调与操作系统深度集成，可调度不同模型处理任务，部分功能可在离线状态下使用。腾讯表示“马维斯”能完成市面主流Agent的大部分工作，并具备桌面操控手机应用等能力。这是继3月WorkBuddy和“龙虾”产品矩阵后，腾讯推出的又一AI助手产品。","reportEdition":"2026-05-21","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpekzpha0dc3slk1bphli6rh","title":"Google Stitch更新：AI设计助手实现全流程构建","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-05-21T00:00:12.163Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpekzpha0dc3slk1bphli6rh","https://x.com/googleaidevs/status/2057209295763300785"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpekzpha0dc3slk1bphli6rh","title":"Google Stitch更新：A