-out"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpe8ugr00agqslk1ssgs8akd","title":"生成式AI是否会沦为科技行业的“越南战争”？公众抵制能否引领AI走向更优的发展路径？","originalTitle":"","summary":"当前生成式AI的狂飙突进正引发深度审视，其潜在风险与社会反弹可能将该技术拖入类似“越南战争”的漫长泥潭。公众的担忧与抵制运动，正从数据隐私、内容真实性到伦理冲击等多方面施加压力，迫使行业进行根本性反思。这些反作用力虽可能延缓发展，却也可能成为校准方向的关键力量，推动技术在安全、透明和负责任的基础上重新定义进步。我们正身处一个充满挑战与不确定性的“有趣时代”。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpe8ugr00agqslk1ssgs8akd","originalUrl":"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/could-generative-ai-could-turn-out","publishedAt":"2026-05-21T00:00:12.163Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1b4wzwz","originalSourceName":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","family":"outlet-a0gkqk","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpe8ugr00agqslk1ssgs8akd","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T12:49:10.831Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1b4wzwz","name":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T12:49:10.831Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"当前生成式AI的狂飙突进正引发深度审视，其潜在风险与社会反弹可能将该技术拖入类似“越南战争”的漫长泥潭。公众的担忧与抵制运动，正从数据隐私、内容真实性到伦理冲击等多方面施加压力，迫使行业进行根本性反思。这些反作用力虽可能延缓发展，却也可能成为校准方向的关键力量，推动技术在安全、透明和负责任的基础上重新定义进步。我们正身处一个充满挑战与不确定性的“有趣时代”。","reportEdition":"2026-05-21","reportKind":"daily"}],"total":24,"partial":false,"itemSourceCount":20,"topics":[{"topic":"模型","count":3},{"topic":"应用","count":8},{"topic":"行业","count":7},{"topic":"研究","count":1},{"topic":"开发","count":5}],"method":"AIHOT 提供选题、摘要与编排；模境保留来源与报告窗口，关